WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
MV Kobra AI is no longer one product: it is a platform.
Here is what was added.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.500
The conversational board: ask in your own words.
Every number comes from your data, not a guess.

3
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Data governance: what is personal, who can see it,
quality across the six DAMA dimensions and auditable lineage.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.500
Load freshness: when each table was last updated.
A dashboard on stale data looks just like a correct one.

5
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:37.000
Custom KPIs: define them with a formula,
without touching a line of code.

6
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.500
AutoML: train a model on your own dataset.
The metric comes from a holdout never used to choose anything.

7
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:53.000
Collection forecast: when the series carries no signal,
it shows the average and says so. It draws no curve.

8
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:59.500
Technical memo: the pipeline in technical and plain language,
exportable as HTML, Word or PDF.

9
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:08.000
Logistics, a module sold separately:
what to discount, what to restock, which customer to win back.

10
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:16.500
And Projects: portfolio health across six dimensions
and the backlog ranked by expected value.

11
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.500
Each module, with your plan or on its own. mvkobranzaia.com
